\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S1}{\ignorespaces Supporting representation and context analyses. (a) Silhouette coefficients by test fold. (b) Context-ablation effects showing paired 95\% confidence intervals of Boundary macro-F1 differences when ablating C/P/N context. The Holm $p$-values are 1.000 across all three Wilcoxon tests, demonstrating that removing this local temporal context does not significantly degrade boundary performance.}}{6}{figure.caption.25}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:sup_representation_context}{{S1}{6}{Supporting representation and context analyses. (a) Silhouette coefficients by test fold. (b) Context-ablation effects showing paired 95\% confidence intervals of Boundary macro-F1 differences when ablating C/P/N context. The Holm $p$-values are 1.000 across all three Wilcoxon tests, demonstrating that removing this local temporal context does not significantly degrade boundary performance}{figure.caption.25}{}}
